While walking a vector, an O(n) sweep over 415 samples costs roughly 2 steps per item. What is the expected operation count?

The loop under study is:

```cpp
int total = 0;
for (int i = 0; i < 415; ++i) {
    total += 2;
}
```

What total is reported?

